<title>USA: State Financial to open Burlington branch.</title>
<headline>State Financial to open Burlington branch.</headline>
<dateline>HALES CORNERS, Wis. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Financial Bank Waterford, a wholly owned banking subsidiary of State Financial Services Corp, said Tuesday it received regulatory approval to open a new full service branch in Burlington, Wis.</p>
<p>It said the new facility is expect to open for business in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
